flowchart LR
    request[Request and policy event]
    proposal[Proposal and review event]
    deploy[Protected workflow event]
    provider[AWS CloudTrail/Config
or Azure Activity Log/Policy]
    runtime[Cluster and platform logs]
    central[Central archive and searchable logs]
    alerts[Security, budget, drift alerts]
    audit[Audit record
IDs, actor, commit, plan hash]
    request --> audit
    proposal --> audit
    deploy --> audit
    provider --> central
    runtime --> central
    central --> alerts
    alerts --> audit
    audit --> operations[Operations and incident review]
